    <briefdescription>
<para>RAII事务作用域守卫 </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>管理数据库事务的生命周期：<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>构造时调用 <ref refid="group___type_erasure_functions_1ga290b3677dff2caee030d0103c306fc5d" kindref="member">begin()</ref></para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="classscope__transaction_1a85924cbbf97b52e888500fdfced0dc61" kindref="member">commit()</ref> 显式提交事务（仅可调用一次）</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>析构时若未提交则调用 rollback()</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>不可复制，支持移动语义。</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Connect</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>连接类型，需满足 <ref refid="structidb__connect" kindref="compound">idb_connect</ref> 接口（提供 begin/commit/rollback） </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
